4,Comparing Nilo-Saharan East Africans And West Africans... | MedShun,https://medshun.com/article/are-nilo-saharan-east-africans-or-west-africans,"Some examples of Nilo-Saharan ethnic groups found in East Africa include the Dinka, Nuer, Shilluk, Maasai, Kalenjin, and Luo. These groups have distinct cultural practices, languages, and traditions that are unique to their respective communities.","Dinka, Northwestern",Nilo-Saharan
