9,Who are the Dinka People of South Sudan? | Piööcku Thuɔŋjäŋ...,https://pioockuthuongjangda.wordpress.com/2012/02/04/who-are-the-dinka-people-of-south-sudan/,"Ruweŋ (Northwestern Dinka). Agaar (South Central Dinka). The Dinka Subtribes According to Geographical Location.All north eastern and north western dinka accept padang as their general category under which they fall. this is not true with Boor, Agaar and Rek.","Dinka, Northwestern",Nilo-Saharan
